category: Science
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libgomp1 libhdf5_320 liblapack0 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Spin-adapted implementation of DMRG for ab initio quantum chemistry (runtime)"
ldesc: "CheMPS2 is a scientific library which contains a spin-adapted implementation
of the density matrix renormalization group (DMRG) for ab initio quantum
chemistry."
external-source: chemps2

